  "identifier": "ants",
  "name": "ANTs (Advanced Normalization Tools)",
  "description": "Widely used open-source toolkit for medical image registration, segmentation, and quantification, with a strong track record in neuroimaging. ANTs provides state-of-the-art diffeomorphic registration, template construction, and brain-extraction/segmentation pipelines, with Python (ANTsPy) and R (ANTsR) bindings.",
